    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "<p>Cool Alpine (inspired by Silver Mountain Water by Creed): a cold drink you can wear</p>",
            "heading_size": 46,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>Some scents just feel like relief, and Cool Alpine is one of them. Inspired by Silver Mountain Water, it opens bright and green with a cool, almost sparkling quality that reads like mountain air even when you are standing on scorching pavement waiting for the walk signal. Green tea, blackcurrant, and a clean musk that keeps the whole thing feeling rinsed and fresh.<br/></p><p>This is a <a href=\"/collections/unisex\" title=\"Unisex\">best unisex perfume</a> in the real sense, easy on anyone, and it is the one to grab when the day is hot and you want to smell like you are handling it rather than slowly melting. Light, smart, and quietly expensive-feeling. The fragrance version of stepping into air conditioning after twenty minutes in a parking lot.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 22,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
            "subheading": "<p>Marine (inspired by Bleu de Chanel): fresh, easy, and impossible to get wrong</p>",
            "subheading_size": 46,
            "subheading_color": "#000000",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>If summer had a default setting, Marine would be it. Inspired by Bleu de Chanel, it is clean citrus over ginger and dry sandalwood, and it nails the one thing every great summer scent has to do: it smells effortless. A best cologne for men that works for a backyard party, a wedding, and a Sunday spent doing absolutely nothing, without ever changing its story.</p><p><br/>It holds up in heat because it is balanced. There is enough freshness up top to keep it breathable and enough warmth in the base to keep it from disappearing the second you step outside. A men's fragrance guys keep in steady rotation precisely because it never asks anything of you. Put it on, forget about it, and get complimented on it anyway.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 22,
            "bottom_text_color": "#000000",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.6
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zVYidR": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_614820f",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The guy who irons his shirts for no reason",
            "heading_size": 50,
            "heading_size_mobile": 32,
            "heading_line_height": 1,
            "heading_color": "#121212",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 50,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 30,
            "column_1_text": "<p>This is the guy who irons his shirts for no particular occasion and always somehow<br/>looks a little more put together than everyone else in the room. Visionary, inspired by Imagination by Louis Vuitton, opens fresh with citron and bergamot, moves through neroli and ginger, and settles into black tea and warm cedar. It is confident without being loud about it, which tracks for a person who has never once needed to<br/>raise his voice to be heard.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>Oud Maracujá by Maison Crivelli belongs in the same conversation. It regularly sells<br/>for $300 to $375 depending on size, built around an unexpected pairing of passionfruit and oud that quickly built a cult following in niche perfumery circles.<br/>Mirage takes the same passionfruit-and-oud contrast and makes it available at a<br/>fraction of the price, so the pairing that made the original famous is not locked<br/>behind a three-figure price tag.</p>",
            "body_size": 20,
            "body_size_mobile": 14,
            "body_line_height": 1.6,
            "body_color": "#000000",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 60,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1000,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
