    "blocks_NgyNz4": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_qVFqqX": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1200,
            "section_padding": 20,
            "background_color": "#f9f6f1",
            "heading": "<p>Eternal Verde (inspired by Hacivat by Nishane): green, crisp, and more interesting than the rest</p>",
            "heading_size": 50,
            "heading_color": "#000000",
            "heading_spacing": 10,
            "box_color": "#8b1d22",
            "box_radius": 25,
            "box_padding": 40,
            "box_spacing": 10,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>For anyone who finds standard summer freshness a little predictable, Eternal Verde is the upgrade. Inspired by Hacivat, it pairs crisp pineapple and bergamot with a green, woody heart that gives it real backbone. Fresh, sure, but with a grown up edge that keeps it from blending into every other citrus scent flooding fragrance TikTok this time of year.</p><p>This one feels like a niche fragrance: the kind that earns a raised eyebrow and a \"wait, what is that?\" from the one friend who actually knows scent. A luxury inspired perfume that reads as intentional rather than default, and it holds its freshness impressively well even when the afternoon refuses to cool off.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#ffffff",
            "box_text_size": 22,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.6,
            "paragraph_spacing": 25,
            "subheading": "<p>Fate (inspired by Chance EDP by Chanel): the one for when the night keeps going</p>",
            "subheading_size": 50,
            "subheading_color": "#000000",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>American summer has a rhythm to it. The day is warm, the evening stays warm, and suddenly you are out on a patio at ten at night, string lights on, nobody in any hurry to leave. Fate is the scent for that stretch. Inspired by Chance, it is pink pepper and jasmine over a soft, warm base: fresh enough for daytime, with enough staying power to carry a night that nobody planned and nobody wants to wrap up. </p><p>A best fragrance for women that bridges the entire day, which matters in a season where you head out in the afternoon and get home a lot later than you meant to. It does not quit when the sun goes down. It just settles in and stays with you.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 22,
            "bottom_text_color": "#000000",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.6
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "ai_gen_block_19f144a_ypgJWf": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_19f144a",
          "settings": {
            "line_1_text": "How to",
            "line_1_alignment": "left",
            "line_1_offset": 205,
            "line_2_text": "actually wear fragrance",
            "line_2_alignment": "center",
            "line_2_offset": 0,
            "line_3_text": "in the heat",
            "line_3_alignment": "right",
            "line_3_offset": -135,
            "body_text": "<p>A few small moves make a real difference in summer. Moisturize first, because warm skin still needs something to hold onto, and hydrated skin holds scent much longer. Stick to pulse points and go lighter than you would in winter, since the heat is already doing half the projecting for you. And keep the bottle out of direct sun; a windowsill in a heat wave will quietly cook a fragrance and dull it over time.</p><p><br/>The practical win with a Scentspired bestseller is simple. High-quality, Swiss-sourced fragrance oil means the scent really lasts through a long, hot day, and at around $20 a bottle you can keep one in your bag for a festival, one in the car, and one by the door without treating any of them like something breakable. That is the whole spirit of summer. You are supposed to be out living in it, not rationing the good stuff.</p>",
            "line_1_size": 42,
            "line_2_size": 55,
            "line_3_size": 42,
            "body_size": 23,
            "line_2_margin_top": 40,
            "line_3_margin_top": -14,
